WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:08.425
ModApps Sales Order Amendments brings governed, auditable change management to confirmed Odoo 19 sales orders.

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:13.725
Select Request Amendment to adjust quantities, unit prices, or commitment dates.

00:00:13.725 --> 00:00:21.900
The system highlights added, modified, and removed lines with clear badges and delta calculations.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.275
Submit the amendment for approval.

00:00:24.275 --> 00:00:30.425
Separation-of-duty rules prevent requesters from approving their own commercial changes.

00:00:30.425 --> 00:00:36.325
An authorized approver reviews the commercial and logistics impact summary.

00:00:36.325 --> 00:00:41.037
Approve and apply the revision in one atomic database transaction.

00:00:41.037 --> 00:00:50.650
The order is updated, unprocessed delivery moves are replaced, and the audit timeline is retained.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:56.975
Generate a one-page Decision Certificate for compliance and customer sign-off.

00:00:56.975 --> 00:00:59.950
Safe, transparent, and built for Odoo.
